---
title: Heavenly Potatoes
author: Judy White
category: Veggies
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@frozen hash browns{1%2 lb bag} (partly frozen)
@cream of chicken soup{1%can}
@cream of mushroom soup{1%can}
@sour cream with chives{12%oz}
@shredded cheddar cheese{2%c}
@crushed potato chips or crackers{2%cups}
@melted butter{2%Tbsp}
@butter{1%stick}

Combine @frozen hash browns{1%2 lb bag}, @cream of chicken soup{1%can}, @cream of mushroom soup{1%can}, @sour cream with chives{12%oz}, and @shredded cheddar cheese{2%c} and put in roasting pan. Top with 2 cups crushed potato chips or crackers mixed with 2 Tbsp melted butter. Melt 1 stick of butter and drizzle over the top. Bake for 45 minutes or until brown and bubbly.
